{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2025-04", "window": 2, "start_date": 1744070400, "end_date": 1744761599, "month_true_total": 115, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 18:06:41 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "192831487", "author": {"steamid": "76561199434595081", "personaname": "Fuyra", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199434595081/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 761, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 567, "last_played": 1782776409, "avatar": "5b8c77aeed6c521508014d3277a3a12d8a68538c"}, "language": "english", "review": "This Might be 14 year old game I now understand. Why it is a cult classic Highly recommend this if you like warhammer and Ultramarines. Killing orcs Is a lots of fun game offers and good challenge. Just a fun story all round.", "timestamp_created": 1744758027, "timestamp_updated": 1744758027, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "192822231", "author": {"steamid": "76561198078246539", "personaname": "Randydextrous", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/randydextrous/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 435, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 435, "last_played": 1744747538, "avatar": "f8b3d5520647f57ff8119595f85c41f7530ac208"}, "language": "english", "review": "It is a pale imitation of games like Gears of War and Halo. Not as beautiful and epic as Halo and not as dynamic combat mechanics as Gears of War. \r\nIf you want to know the backstory for Space Marine 2, I suggest you find a video of it online instead.", "timestamp_created": 1